<title>MALAYSIA: MALAYSIA OCEAN CAPITAL DEBUTS AT 6.8 RGT.</title>
<headline>MALAYSIA OCEAN CAPITAL DEBUTS AT 6.8 RGT.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1997-08-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Department store owner Ocean Capital Bhd debuted on the Kuala Lumpur Stock Exchange at 6.8 ringgit against an offer price of 3.0 ringgit.</p>
<p>The company offered for sale 5.99 million existing shares as part of its listing exercise.  </p>
<p>The company has forecast a net profit of 12.57 million ringgit for calender 1997 against 9.14 million last year.</p>
<p>At the debut price of 6.8 ringgit, the share is trading on a price-to-earnings ratio of 19.35 times against 8.54 at the issue price.</p>
